## 6. Supporting comparison/debug tooling

### Timestamp

- Line profile compare tool files appear in Project File search around **2026-05-03**.

### Purpose

A helper tool was created to compare copied/canvas/staged files by:

- total line count
- total character count
- per-line character counts
- optional normalized per-line counts
- first differing line
- missing/extra line structure

### Caveat

This is a copy/completeness aid, not a semantic proof. Same-length substitutions can pass the profile. Use it before deeper code review when canvas/chats/copied files may have formatting or line-ending drift.

